    {"path": "references/feature-scaffold.md", "loadAt": "路径B-阶段1", "purpose": "澄清式功能开发：提问脚本、L/P/D/M/R 布局库、功能→布局映射、蓝图模板、硬性规则"},
    {"path": "references/component-library.md", "loadAt": "Step3", "purpose": "组件片段"},
